{"screen_name": "yumemiya_saya", "file": "yumemiya_saya", "name": "夢宮サヤ（skeb募集中）", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1966691561758224385/pABZdqKK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1919395872951197696/1752758363/1500x500", "description": "宝石のような少年少女達をテーマに描いてます skeb、依頼などに関するホムペ→ https://lit.link/sayamahou_tukai", "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5200, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 5200}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5200, "max": 5200}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/yumemiya_saya", "name": "yumemiya_saya"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@Yumesaya", "name": "Yumesaya"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/sayamahou_tukai", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/93318430", "name": "93318430"}], "works": [{"path": "/@yumemiya_saya/works/40", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/da33c69f/uploads/origins/36878419-1fbf-4cc2-8e17-3571b91c0391?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11db1e72fe85ca92c7989bf4adb8804a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da33c69f/uploads/origins/36878419-1fbf-4cc2-8e17-3571b91c0391?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11db1e72fe85ca92c7989bf4adb8804a, https://si.imgix.net/da33c69f/uploads/origins/36878419-1fbf-4cc2-8e17-3571b91c0391?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e57bbac2af9ee95595cb9ea415af2426 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da33c69f/uploads/origins/36878419-1fbf-4cc2-8e17-3571b91c0391?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37e495eed1ff86750e884b609ad8eebc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたの絵はとても可愛いです。スタイルが美しく明るいですね。私のキャラクター「華葉」を描いていただけませんか？彼女はとても小柄で上品な女の子です。お姫様のように育てられましたが、とても甘えん坊で可愛い服が大好きです。上品で控えめな性格です。お願いを聞いてくださりありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MfXH-7e_5EBDLHlHAQazRO11zUMPxo0j?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yumemiya_saya/works/39", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e8df6c22/uploads/origins/e13a8b26-cdd4-4aba-b4fd-7bda5c88588c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f3352584e31bf579ed51edd1796000c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e8df6c22/uploads/origins/e13a8b26-cdd4-4aba-b4fd-7bda5c88588c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f3352584e31bf579ed51edd1796000c, https://si.imgix.net/e8df6c22/uploads/origins/e13a8b26-cdd4-4aba-b4fd-7bda5c88588c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88bcbf7aec83e04c2de5fbf22649c6c0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e8df6c22/uploads/origins/e13a8b26-cdd4-4aba-b4fd-7bda5c88588c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59355c9424890591966b77c4e92e8982 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "夢宮サヤさん、skebでははじめまして！是非私のミスキーでの代理キャラを描いてください！\n\n私の代理キャラは御剣中身ちゃん。キャラクターの設定は私のミスキーのページのヘッダーから、私のミスキーОＣプロフィールのリンクを参照してください。設定は１枚しかありませんが、リンクの一番下にノートされている子です。他の方に描いていただいたイラストのリンクもありますので、参考にしてくださると嬉しいです。\n\n構図やポーズ等はお任せ致しますが、お願いしたいことが２点ございます。\n①中身ちゃんが現実の私が愛用しているワコムのプロペン３を右手に持ち、空間に絵を描いている感じで作画してください。\n②ミスキーのマスコットキャラである、にゃんぷっぷーを左手に抱いたり、背景に散りばめたりして中身ちゃんと絡めてください。\n\nお願いは以上です。どうかよろしくお願い致します\n\nhttps://misskey.io/@miturugikensuke", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yumemiya_saya/works/38", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2608866/uploads/origins/e559730e-60e9-4a0c-ad66-ba929b5ab5fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec0582e177e7edef268afe8c3f29651", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2608866/uploads/origins/e559730e-60e9-4a0c-ad66-ba929b5ab5fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dec0582e177e7edef268afe8c3f29651, https://si.imgix.net/a2608866/uploads/origins/e559730e-60e9-4a0c-ad66-ba929b5ab5fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddd7e848c3bddf9b8beba8c495ff2f21 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2608866/uploads/origins/e559730e-60e9-4a0c-ad66-ba929b5ab5fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f91090b79d055c3419a731ba4c5140c0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Saya, I'd love it if you could draw a new outfit for my OC. He's a boy who crossdresses and likes to wear tights. He should have the same hair, except the side braid should be gone. I can't decide on the tights, so I've included two different pairs in the references. You can choose which one matches the overall outfit better in terms of pattern, but you can change the colors. His shoes should be the same colors as in the reference. They should also fit like the example picture. I'll leave the rest of his clothes up to you, as long as they're not too feminine. Thank you so much\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/ikr3nYDeKqaKoM8X7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}